  "text": "broad jump burpees/navy seals\n\n1. guy with perfect form\n2. guy w/ less perfect form (me trying to get that \"pop\" off the ground like 1st video, cant do it)\n3. \"busy dad training\" slow-mo navy seal burpee instructions\n4. I hadn't heard of hyrox until yesterday, was poking around, lots of videos of broad jump burpees done wrong (climbing up off the ground one leg at a time) - this dude has the right pace - these will destroy u, I did them on the beach with a buddy last weekend, he almost threw up lol\n\nsome of the better advice I got in my 30's was \"train like an athlete\"...less weights, more calisthenics, stay loose, stay agile. that, and \"ur never too old to fall in love with working out\" -- truer words...",
